cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Polymarket Per-Category Exponential Hazard Rates"
abstract: >-
  Per-category exponential hazard fits for the time-to-event distribution on
  Polymarket deadline-resolved contracts. Each fit reports the MLE point
  estimate, 95% confidence interval, half-life, KS goodness-of-fit p-value,
  and underlying sample market IDs. Used as the baseline survival function in
  the deadline-Information Leakage Score (ILS-dl) framework of the
  ForesightFlow programme.
type: dataset
